Containers
==========

OCI images, primarily based on Nix.

postgres-18
  PostgreSQL 18 with pgactive, pg_rational, pg_clickhouse, pgvector, and pgque SQL scripts.
  - ghcr.io/aca/containers/postgres-18:latest-amd64
  - ghcr.io/aca/containers/postgres-18:latest-arm64

postgres-19
  PostgreSQL 19 with pgactive, pg_rational, pg_clickhouse, pgvector, and pgque SQL scripts.
  - ghcr.io/aca/containers/postgres-19:latest-amd64
  - ghcr.io/aca/containers/postgres-19:latest-arm64

clickhouse-26.8
  ClickHouse 26.8 LTS with HTTP (8123) and native (9000) interfaces.
  - ghcr.io/aca/containers/clickhouse-26.8:latest-amd64
  - ghcr.io/aca/containers/clickhouse-26.8:latest-arm64
